<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήλ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is emulated: object of envy</i> or
			<i>ambition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.27S.
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>high fortune</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				379
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τυραννικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.55
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl. also,
				<i>emulous efforts, rivalries</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέων ζ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.191
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.219
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pomp.
			</span></i> Jun.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.260
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>emulation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήλωμα τῆς τῶν Ῥωμαίων ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.113
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				355
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				7.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
